*VERSION: 3.0
*WRITTEN_BY: openair-conformance
* Tests: an AN command written before the AC command of its airspace belongs to the airspace before it.

AC D
AY CTR
AN Example CTR
AH 4500 FT AMSL
AL GND
DP 46:00:00N 014:00:00E
DP 46:00:00N 014:10:00E
DP 45:55:00N 014:10:00E
DP 45:55:00N 014:00:00E
DP 46:00:00N 014:00:00E
AN Example TMA
AC C
AY TMA
AH FL95
AL 4500 FT AMSL
V X=46:30:00N 014:30:00E
DC 5
